descriere:
Nivel de vechime: Nivel mediu de experiență
Tip de angajare: Full-time
Sectoare de activitate: Bănci și Servicii financiare
Mission: 
 To provide structured, timely, and actionable data insights across the company, with a primary focus on supporting Credit Risk Management and Marketing. The role bridges data architecture requirements with day-to-day operational and strategic analytics, ensuring high data quality, accessibility, and readiness for AI-driven risk and business processes.
 Responsibilities: 
Collaborate with stakeholders (especially Credit Risk and Marketing) to define data needs and reporting structures;
Support the design and documentation of the overall data architecture and data flows;
Identify and recommend appropriate tools and platforms for data analytics (BI tools, cloud storage, etc.);
Extract, clean, and transform data from internal and external sources;
Develop and maintain reports, dashboards, and visualizations for cross-functional teams;
Conduct exploratory data analysis to uncover trends, anomalies, and actionable insights;
Ensure data integrity and consistency across systems and processes;
Stay informed on AI-powered data tools (e.g. AutoML, AI copilots) and apply them when relevant
 Competencies: 
Strong SQL and data manipulation skills;
Familiarity with data visualization tools (Power BI, Quick Sight, Looker, etc.);
Understanding of data modeling concepts and architecture best practices;
Comfortable working with data warehouses, ETL pipelines, and APIs;
Ability to clearly translate business questions into analytical queries;
Awareness of regulatory data handling requirements (e.g., GDPR);
 Soft skills: 
Strong business acumen and problem-solving skills;
Clear communicator with both technical and non-technical stakeholders;
Proactive, hands-on, and eager to learn;
Curious and open to emerging AI technologies in the data domain;
Flexible, team-oriented mindset suited to a fast-moving startup environment;
Fluency in Romanian and English;
4+ years of experience in a data analyst or business intelligence role;
Startup or scale-up experience is a plus;
Willingness to take part in the evolution of an AI-first risk and operations platform.
